  "description": "This lighter recipe for faluda froths puréed raspberries with milk. You could sweeten it as much as you like, layer it with whipped cream, or spike it with ginger and cardamom. This lighter version just adds a garnish of candied ginger, which you could also dice up and add to the basil seed.",
